          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/elevation-of-privilege",
          "message": {
            "text": "Object identifiers in requests to edge-gateway are trusted without an ownership check, so a caller can read or change inbound API requests that belong to others.",
            "markdown": "Check ownership or entitlement for every object reference at edge-gateway on the server, and deny by default when the check cannot be made."
          },
