          "message": {
            "text": "Backups and exports of credential assertions and session grants on auth-broker are writable by operators without a second approver, so a malicious change survives restores.",
            "markdown": "Protect exports and backups of credential assertions and session grants with write-once storage and dual approval for restore, and verify checksums against a separately held manifest."
