          "message": {
            "text": "An attacker who can write to the channel between auth-broker and edge-gateway modifies inbound API requests in transit because messages carry no integrity protection of their own.",
            "markdown": "Sign messages between auth-broker and edge-gateway with a per-service key and verify the signature and a monotonic counter before accepting any change."
          },
